(3934754, 559914, 30757, '<td valign="top">to be honest, great idea but the composition is not really nice done. the hole thing is out of balance. for example, the carrots are sticking out, looks funny but not like carrots and the same for the maiz. if you had filled up the basket with newspapers first the veggies would have been together with the hings of the bag. Would have been nicer i think. The green leaves are nearly dead thou? Try to put the next time a little bit more the greens with the greens and the reds with etc. This will make the composition more nice.</td>', 'to be honest, great idea but the composition is not really nice done. the hole thing is out of balance. for example, the carrots are sticking out, looks funny but not like carrots and the same for the maiz. if you had filled up the basket with newspapers first the veggies would have been together with the hings of the bag. Would have been nicer i think. The green leaves are nearly dead thou? Try to put the next time a little bit more the greens with the greens and the reds with etc. This will make the composition more nice.', '2007-07-25 06:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
