(3936753, 560494, 70000, '<td valign="top">the colors and textures here work together really well, but the weirdly colored border ruins it for me. i would try no border or a black one</td>', 'the colors and textures here work together really well, but the weirdly colored border ruins it for me. i would try no border or a black one', '2007-07-25 17:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936755, 557720, 66310, '<td valign="top">Is it the forgotten, or the lost (because that is usually what happens to me)</td>', 'Is it the forgotten, or the lost (because that is usually what happens to me)', '2007-07-25 17:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936762, 558959, 70000, '<td valign="top">the flower at the bottom is an interesting touch, id love to know how you got this color arangement. neat shot</td>', 'the flower at the bottom is an interesting touch, id love to know how you got this color arangement. neat shot', '2007-07-25 17:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936765, 559515, 70000, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful! It is unexpected and really well composed. beautiful shot</td>', 'this is beautiful! It is unexpected and really well composed. beautiful shot', '2007-07-25 17:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936767, 559433, 66310, '<td valign="top">I really like this!! Well done!</td>', 'I really like this!! Well done!', '2007-07-25 17:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936769, 559515, 66310, '<td valign="top">I like. The high key effect really works with this shot....7</td>', 'I like. The high key effect really works with this shot....7', '2007-07-25 17:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936781, 559408, 79562, '<td valign="top">does this qualify as still life?</td>', 'does this qualify as still life?', '2007-07-25 17:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936799, 558325, 79562, '<td valign="top">a little dark, but nice shot!</td>', 'a little dark, but nice shot!', '2007-07-25 17:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936897, 560408, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, color choice and the harsh lighting is actually pretty nice.  I would prefer some detail in those specular highlights (the bright spots).  That can be accomplished by placing a sheet or something opaque in front of the light source (to create a "soft box").  I would also like to see some detail in the shadow below the apples to give them something to rest on.  Good still life.</td>', 'I love the composition, color choice and the harsh lighting is actually pretty nice.  I would prefer some detail in those specular highlights (the bright spots).  That can be accomplished by placing a sheet or something opaque in front of the light source (to create a "soft box").  I would also like to see some detail in the shadow below the apples to give them something to rest on.  Good still life.', '2007-07-25 17:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936905, 559541, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''m sure your getting plenty of "not still life" so I''ll comment on the photo itself....I love the pattern created by the tips of the flowers and you''ve got some decent contrast going.  The bee is OOF however which ruins the mood for me.  Good use of rule of thirds in your composition.</td>', 'I''m sure your getting plenty of "not still life" so I''ll comment on the photo itself....I love the pattern created by the tips of the flowers and you''ve got some decent contrast going.  The bee is OOF however which ruins the mood for me.  Good use of rule of thirds in your composition.', '2007-07-25 17:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936912, 557785, 68256, '<td valign="top">The colors and "abstractness" is wonderful!  I actually wish the whole thing was as OOF as the top petals..(I bet you''ve never heard that before!)...The sharp stamen kinda breaks the flow up.  I also wished the whole frame was filled with petals (leaving out the dark background gaps).....Overall nice photo and I bet it would love beautiful on a wall....</td>', 'The colors and "abstractness" is wonderful!  I actually wish the whole thing was as OOF as the top petals..(I bet you''ve never heard that before!)...The sharp stamen kinda breaks the flow up.  I also wished the whole frame was filled with petals (leaving out the dark background gaps).....Overall nice photo and I bet it would love beautiful on a wall....', '2007-07-25 18:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936960, 559465, 80878, '<td valign="top">Ha love the title!</td>', 'Ha love the title!', '2007-07-25 18:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936972, 558959, 79904, '<td valign="top">I''m loving this shot.  Great job.</td>', 'I''m loving this shot.  Great job.', '2007-07-25 18:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3936993, 559548, 68599, '<td valign="top">wow very creative</td>', 'wow very creative', '2007-07-25 18:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3937074, 559910, 72782, '<td valign="top">I Like this.  I twould be interesting to see it done with a longer depth of field</td>', 'I Like this.  I twould be interesting to see it done with a longer depth of field', '2007-07-25 19:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3937076, 559314, 69487, '<td valign="top">Oh man I bet your getting hammered.  Yeah my art teacher would give me an F for painting this!<br/> <br/>Still congrats on getting the rain, Ive been trying to capture falling drops and never have even got streaks.  Film or Digital.</td>', 'Oh man I bet your getting hammered.  Yeah my art teacher would give me an F for painting this! Still congrats on getting the rain, Ive been trying to capture falling drops and never have even got streaks.  Film or Digital.', '2007-07-25 19:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
