(3938621, 558192, 49109, '<td valign="top">definitely not a still life - and far from any photographic merits: too dark, little detail, lack of focus and composition</td>', 'definitely not a still life - and far from any photographic merits: too dark, little detail, lack of focus and composition', '2007-07-26 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
