(3938921, 559543, 68256, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge but for some unexplainable reason this composition doesn''t work for me.  Maybe more DOF, or tighter crop...I do like the angles created with the crayons and game boxes.  It is very colorful, but the lighing doesn''t seem to enhance those colors as much as I would expect...maybe you neededed more modeling with shadows using a brighter second light?  6</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge but for some unexplainable reason this composition doesn''t work for me.  Maybe more DOF, or tighter crop...I do like the angles created with the crayons and game boxes.  It is very colorful, but the lighing doesn''t seem to enhance those colors as much as I would expect...maybe you neededed more modeling with shadows using a brighter second light?  6', '2007-07-26 09:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938965, 560546, 5354, '<td valign="top">just needs something like a rose laid across it or on the floor at the side</td>', 'just needs something like a rose laid across it or on the floor at the side', '2007-07-26 09:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
