(3938975, 560004, 5354, '<td valign="top">not exactly ''still life'', but a nice pic</td>', 'not exactly ''still life'', but a nice pic', '2007-07-26 09:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938983, 560270, 68256, '<td valign="top">I think on DPC a photo of a flower has to be spectacular to do well...there are too many little things in your photo that will bring down your score I''m afraid.  Like the main subject blending in with the background petals, right bottom corner distraction and distractions on the left.  Typically with a still life you can control all of those distractions by moving the flower around.  Speaking of which I''m sure some are voting low because they feel this doesn''t meet the qualifications of a still life.  With all that being said, I like this photo and the composition and give it a 6.  I just wanted to say some things because I figured your score was suffering and I wanted to perhaps help you understand why.</td>', 'I think on DPC a photo of a flower has to be spectacular to do well...there are too many little things in your photo that will bring down your score I''m afraid.  Like the main subject blending in with the background petals, right bottom corner distraction and distractions on the left.  Typically with a still life you can control all of those distractions by moving the flower around.  Speaking of which I''m sure some are voting low because they feel this doesn''t meet the qualifications of a still life.  With all that being said, I like this photo and the composition and give it a 6.  I just wanted to say some things because I figured your score was suffering and I wanted to perhaps help you understand why.', '2007-07-26 09:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938987, 560403, 5354, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little harshly lit, the highlights have blown out pure white. Try a light tent to control and diffuse the light</td>', 'Perhaps a little harshly lit, the highlights have blown out pure white. Try a light tent to control and diffuse the light', '2007-07-26 09:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938997, 557334, 68256, '<td valign="top">It is a nice composition and color scheme but the softness is a little to much for me...I would have like to seen more texture in the bottom of the egg and petals.  It is a still life so you started on a higher scale .... 7</td>', 'It is a nice composition and color scheme but the softness is a little to much for me...I would have like to seen more texture in the bottom of the egg and petals.  It is a still life so you started on a higher scale .... 7', '2007-07-26 09:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939010, 560079, 68256, '<td valign="top">This could have been really great with more diffused light...the blown specular highlights are just too much for me.  If you could have created a softbox or put a sheet in front of the light I think those highlights would have been less harsh and transparent and the lighting would have been better.  Just my opinion of course.  I love the composition and subject. 7</td>', 'This could have been really great with more diffused light...the blown specular highlights are just too much for me.  If you could have created a softbox or put a sheet in front of the light I think those highlights would have been less harsh and transparent and the lighting would have been better.  Just my opinion of course.  I love the composition and subject. 7', '2007-07-26 10:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939017, 560541, 68256, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  I like the patterns and "abstractness", but I think I would have liked it even more with greater DOF.  The pattern would have been even stronger.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  I like the patterns and "abstractness", but I think I would have liked it even more with greater DOF.  The pattern would have been even stronger.', '2007-07-26 10:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939031, 559952, 68256, '<td valign="top">good compostion, great control of DOF to get the needed parts in focus and supporting features OOF.  Bright yellows really draw your eye in....My only complaint is the black outline on some of the petals...maybe over sharpened?  7</td>', 'good compostion, great control of DOF to get the needed parts in focus and supporting features OOF.  Bright yellows really draw your eye in....My only complaint is the black outline on some of the petals...maybe over sharpened?  7', '2007-07-26 10:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939041, 559984, 68256, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and I like all those leading lines and patterns.  I wished the green filled the whole photo (like perhaps cropping off the whole left side), and I don''t like the blown tips of the plant on the left.  Nice DOF and lighting.....</td>', 'Interesting composition and I like all those leading lines and patterns.  I wished the green filled the whole photo (like perhaps cropping off the whole left side), and I don''t like the blown tips of the plant on the left.  Nice DOF and lighting.....', '2007-07-26 10:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
