(3939158, 557877, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the harmony of both color and subject...I like the fact that you balanced it out with the new potatoes on left and right side too.  I''m not sure the overhead perspective is to my liking though as it makes everything look "flat".  Perhaps a little less straight on perspective would have been better?  Great lighting.....</td>', 'I love the harmony of both color and subject...I like the fact that you balanced it out with the new potatoes on left and right side too.  I''m not sure the overhead perspective is to my liking though as it makes everything look "flat".  Perhaps a little less straight on perspective would have been better?  Great lighting.....', '2007-07-26 10:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939180, 559666, 68256, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement but I think it would have been even nicer had you created a traditional s curve with the bannana and flowers...(instead of the flowers all being vertical).  The lighting is OK, but a little harsh.  If you could soften the light some with a diffuser like a sheet or bounce it off of a wall it would have been a little less harsh.  The background is what is killing the photo for me however (I''m sure your hearing that already)...the colors just don''t seem in harmony....  I am giving you extra credit for creating a traditional still life though for an overall score of 6.</td>', 'Nice arrangement but I think it would have been even nicer had you created a traditional s curve with the bannana and flowers...(instead of the flowers all being vertical).  The lighting is OK, but a little harsh.  If you could soften the light some with a diffuser like a sheet or bounce it off of a wall it would have been a little less harsh.  The background is what is killing the photo for me however (I''m sure your hearing that already)...the colors just don''t seem in harmony....  I am giving you extra credit for creating a traditional still life though for an overall score of 6.', '2007-07-26 10:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939202, 558970, 52115, '<td valign="top">Did you realize that while you''re alive, "you''re still life", full of life.<br/>Then after you are lifeless, "you''re still life" also, much stiller.<br/> <br/>I''ve thought of this idea for a photo, too. The colors are bright, the white tarp seems to detract from the main subject. This may have been entered into the other Faceless Emotion challenge.</td>', 'Did you realize that while you''re alive, "you''re still life", full of life.Then after you are lifeless, "you''re still life" also, much stiller. I''ve thought of this idea for a photo, too. The colors are bright, the white tarp seems to detract from the main subject. This may have been entered into the other Faceless Emotion challenge.', '2007-07-26 11:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
