(3939412, 560490, 37930, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, nice DOF. Glad to see none of the flowers are blown out. A little more light on the red/orange flower would have been ideal, but this is close.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, nice DOF. Glad to see none of the flowers are blown out. A little more light on the red/orange flower would have been ideal, but this is close.', '2007-07-26 12:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
