(3939426, 559397, 37930, '<td valign="top">There''s not enough light on the front of the statue which somewhat detracts from the effect of the image. I usually take a nice bright wide-beam flashlight with me for reasons such as this (it''s easier to carry around than a flash, and I don''t have a flash anyways except for the built-in).<br/> <br/>I think it wouldn''t have made such a difference if the sky behind it wasn''t so bright, but it just makes the subject hard to look at.<br/> <br/>I do like the shot, just a little constructive criticism.</td>', 'There''s not enough light on the front of the statue which somewhat detracts from the effect of the image. I usually take a nice bright wide-beam flashlight with me for reasons such as this (it''s easier to carry around than a flash, and I don''t have a flash anyways except for the built-in). I think it wouldn''t have made such a difference if the sky behind it wasn''t so bright, but it just makes the subject hard to look at. I do like the shot, just a little constructive criticism.', '2007-07-26 12:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939435, 559571, 37930, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea but I think if there was some way to make the flowers appear vertically in the frame instead of straight out at the camera it would have worked better.</td>', 'Very cool idea but I think if there was some way to make the flowers appear vertically in the frame instead of straight out at the camera it would have worked better.', '2007-07-26 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939442, 560199, 74605, '<td valign="top">Nice wood tones and textures.</td>', 'Nice wood tones and textures.', '2007-07-26 12:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939443, 559976, 78354, '<td valign="top">The leafes on the left are a bit distracting and not in balance with the composition. Beautifull color combination and light. Very well done!</td>', 'The leafes on the left are a bit distracting and not in balance with the composition. Beautifull color combination and light. Very well done!', '2007-07-26 12:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939444, 558959, 37930, '<td valign="top">Impressive. Looks very surreal, if this was accomplished with basic editing rules then kudos to you (and I have faith that it was =)<br/> <br/>Can''t think of any constructive criticism, or any criticism at all for that matter.</td>', 'Impressive. Looks very surreal, if this was accomplished with basic editing rules then kudos to you (and I have faith that it was =) Can''t think of any constructive criticism, or any criticism at all for that matter.', '2007-07-26 12:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
