(3939612, 560206, 74605, '<td valign="top">Nice, one of favorites.  The arrangment is great, and the textures nice.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice, one of favorites.  The arrangment is great, and the textures nice.  Well done.', '2007-07-26 13:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939749, 558840, 77724, '<td valign="top">and very nice lines and tones at that.  love the refraction in the glass.</td>', 'and very nice lines and tones at that.  love the refraction in the glass.', '2007-07-26 14:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939752, 558462, 77724, '<td valign="top">I like this.  varying degrees of focus on the staggered bottles adss interest.  light could be a little softer.</td>', 'I like this.  varying degrees of focus on the staggered bottles adss interest.  light could be a little softer.', '2007-07-26 14:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939753, 559784, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very simple and elegant..I love the flat lighting with no highlights, choice of colors and non uniform arrangement.  10</td>', 'Very simple and elegant..I love the flat lighting with no highlights, choice of colors and non uniform arrangement.  10', '2007-07-26 14:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939756, 559693, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful!  10<br/> <br/>I really don''t know why I say this is beautiful...I guess the lighting is, but the subject is kinda homely.  Nevertheless you have shown it''s best side.</td>', 'Very beautiful!  10 I really don''t know why I say this is beautiful...I guess the lighting is, but the subject is kinda homely.  Nevertheless you have shown it''s best side.', '2007-07-26 14:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939764, 559112, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice...I usually don''t like such busy compositions but this really works with all those wonderful colors.  You can let yourself relax and enjoy the abstractness and shapes, or you can focus in on specific elements...well done 10<br/> <br/>PS, I like the choice of red background instead of black for what it is worth...</td>', 'Very nice...I usually don''t like such busy compositions but this really works with all those wonderful colors.  You can let yourself relax and enjoy the abstractness and shapes, or you can focus in on specific elements...well done 10 PS, I like the choice of red background instead of black for what it is worth...', '2007-07-26 14:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939765, 560123, 68256, '<td valign="top">Nice artichoke!  Well lit and composed.  9</td>', 'Nice artichoke!  Well lit and composed.  9', '2007-07-26 14:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939771, 560461, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very strange and alluring subject...I don''t really even know what it is.  I love the muted tones though.  I''m giving it a 9 and would have given a 10 if it weren''t for the distracting sides on the background (Well I like the right side that keeps you in the photo, but the left side is distracting).</td>', 'Very strange and alluring subject...I don''t really even know what it is.  I love the muted tones though.  I''m giving it a 9 and would have given a 10 if it weren''t for the distracting sides on the background (Well I like the right side that keeps you in the photo, but the left side is distracting).', '2007-07-26 14:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939773, 559753, 68256, '<td valign="top">classic still life so you get extra credit  :).  The subjects are so unlrelated that it confuses me and I don''t know if I like it or love it.  Either way your lighting is fantastic.  I love the fact that you used a softbox to get those beautiful transparent specular highlights (or at least you recreated that look with whatever you used!).  I''m having a hard time comeing up with a final score ... 9 for now but I really wished that pepper wasn''t there.</td>', 'classic still life so you get extra credit  :).  The subjects are so unlrelated that it confuses me and I don''t know if I like it or love it.  Either way your lighting is fantastic.  I love the fact that you used a softbox to get those beautiful transparent specular highlights (or at least you recreated that look with whatever you used!).  I''m having a hard time comeing up with a final score ... 9 for now but I really wished that pepper wasn''t there.', '2007-07-26 14:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939777, 560490, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color choice and composition.  A perfect 10 if you could have kept a little more detail and seperation in the yellow flower..9</td>', 'Beautiful color choice and composition.  A perfect 10 if you could have kept a little more detail and seperation in the yellow flower..9', '2007-07-26 14:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939778, 560546, 68256, '<td valign="top">Hey that looks very similar to my daughter''s violin!  I had taken a still life of it too for this challenge but decided on another shot.  You have captured it beautifully and I love the placement and lighting.  This is a classic still life and well done...9<br/> <br/>Here is mine:<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=558088<br/> <br/>We''ve always wondered about the history of ours.  Is yours made by Joseph Guarnerius?  Perhaps ours is too???? What is on the back of yours?</td>', 'Hey that looks very similar to my daughter''s violin!  I had taken a still life of it too for this challenge but decided on another shot.  You have captured it beautifully and I love the placement and lighting.  This is a classic still life and well done...9 Here is mine://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=558088 We''ve always wondered about the history of ours.  Is yours made by Joseph Guarnerius?  Perhaps ours is too???? What is on the back of yours?', '2007-07-26 14:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939781, 560396, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting.  I love the concentric circles that lead you right to the fruit....9</td>', 'Great composition and lighting.  I love the concentric circles that lead you right to the fruit....9', '2007-07-26 14:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939782, 560046, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and professionally done.  Those nuts are really lively!  Thanks for providing some light around the mug so it isn''t floating in space, I appreciate that.  I love the specular higlight that isn''t overwhelming and the great modeling light.  The only suggestion would be to perhaps include a background light just to give it a little more "classical" feel, but that is just a personal preference.  Oh yea and those crumbs don''t do anything for me :)<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'Great lighting and professionally done.  Those nuts are really lively!  Thanks for providing some light around the mug so it isn''t floating in space, I appreciate that.  I love the specular higlight that isn''t overwhelming and the great modeling light.  The only suggestion would be to perhaps include a background light just to give it a little more "classical" feel, but that is just a personal preference.  Oh yea and those crumbs don''t do anything for me :) 9', '2007-07-26 14:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939783, 560442, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  The composition is great, and lighting is wonderful.  You''ve given the shell something to rest on too which makes a big difference.  I really love the fact that you used a separation light so there isn''t any light spill onto your subject and I''m assuming that is what caused the warm glow...The only small nitpick is that it appears sharpness has suffered from something...perhaps shallow DOF or the lens...it is not enough to take away from a beatiful composition though.  9 for now but I''ll probably come back and bump to 10 depending on other shots I see....</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  The composition is great, and lighting is wonderful.  You''ve given the shell something to rest on too which makes a big difference.  I really love the fact that you used a separation light so there isn''t any light spill onto your subject and I''m assuming that is what caused the warm glow...The only small nitpick is that it appears sharpness has suffered from something...perhaps shallow DOF or the lens...it is not enough to take away from a beatiful composition though.  9 for now but I''ll probably come back and bump to 10 depending on other shots I see....', '2007-07-26 14:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939787, 559515, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Great high key shot with good seperation from background.  I love the natural vignetting from the background light.  My favorite aspect is the diagnonal created by the feather...great touch. 10</td>', 'Very nice!  Great high key shot with good seperation from background.  I love the natural vignetting from the background light.  My favorite aspect is the diagnonal created by the feather...great touch. 10', '2007-07-26 14:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939788, 558379, 68256, '<td valign="top">very interesting still life (well for me anyway!).  I love the "wiltedness" of the leaves that gives emotion to the plant.  The bright blown highlight at the top of the vase is distracting however.  <br/> <br/>I like the inclusion of a back light to give it a classic portrait feel.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'very interesting still life (well for me anyway!).  I love the "wiltedness" of the leaves that gives emotion to the plant.  The bright blown highlight at the top of the vase is distracting however.   I like the inclusion of a back light to give it a classic portrait feel. 8', '2007-07-26 14:26:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3939792, 560118, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great job making it look natural with all those beads of dew....nice lighting too.  You handled the fill side so well that everthing is 3d....9</td>', 'Great job making it look natural with all those beads of dew....nice lighting too.  You handled the fill side so well that everthing is 3d....9', '2007-07-26 14:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939793, 560206, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''m rating this very high because I love the muted golden tones.  The garlic looks so nice! I guess it could have been "crisper" for the average DPC voter, but I like it just the way it is.</td>', 'I''m rating this very high because I love the muted golden tones.  The garlic looks so nice! I guess it could have been "crisper" for the average DPC voter, but I like it just the way it is.', '2007-07-26 14:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939796, 558959, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition...poor flower has seen some rough days huh?  Don''t worry though you are still beautiful!</td>', 'Great lighting and composition...poor flower has seen some rough days huh?  Don''t worry though you are still beautiful!', '2007-07-26 14:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939798, 559792, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great subject, lighting and composition.  I like the shallow DOF too...nice job.</td>', 'Great subject, lighting and composition.  I like the shallow DOF too...nice job.', '2007-07-26 14:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939799, 559453, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very well done with the textures, lighting, pattern, tone and composition.  I''m not sure how folks will vote for a non traditional still life, but I like it alot.</td>', 'Very well done with the textures, lighting, pattern, tone and composition.  I''m not sure how folks will vote for a non traditional still life, but I like it alot.', '2007-07-26 14:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939802, 558821, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great classic still life.  I love seing these classic compositions and you have lit it so well.  Thanks.</td>', 'Great classic still life.  I love seing these classic compositions and you have lit it so well.  Thanks.', '2007-07-26 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939803, 560315, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really like it, but I think this one needed a background light to give seperation.  I think just a little light from the back would have helped.  8</td>', 'I really like it, but I think this one needed a background light to give seperation.  I think just a little light from the back would have helped.  8', '2007-07-26 14:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939807, 559548, 81082, '<td valign="top">Great picture! I really like how you skewed the music notes - awesome.</td>', 'Great picture! I really like how you skewed the music notes - awesome.', '2007-07-26 14:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939811, 560438, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful thoughtful composition.  The colors match perfect...diagonal line, pattern and good lighting.  Maybe just a little more space (even if it was a 10 px white border) would have been even nicer for my taste anyway.  9</td>', 'Wonderful thoughtful composition.  The colors match perfect...diagonal line, pattern and good lighting.  Maybe just a little more space (even if it was a 10 px white border) would have been even nicer for my taste anyway.  9', '2007-07-26 14:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939815, 559309, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love you choice of lighting...very well done!  It really accentuates the pattern and natural beauty of the subject.   Good composition too...</td>', 'I love you choice of lighting...very well done!  It really accentuates the pattern and natural beauty of the subject.   Good composition too...', '2007-07-26 14:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939819, 559571, 81082, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective. I like the twist on the traditional flower-in-a-vase.</td>', 'Neat perspective. I like the twist on the traditional flower-in-a-vase.', '2007-07-26 14:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939820, 560569, 68256, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is awesome, but I wished the crop wasn''t so tight (it is a strange crop for my taste...)  Great specular highlights that didn''t blow out....</td>', 'Your lighting is awesome, but I wished the crop wasn''t so tight (it is a strange crop for my taste...)  Great specular highlights that didn''t blow out....', '2007-07-26 14:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939821, 559655, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wow that is a lot of negative space!  I like it..simple, elegant, and good lighting....8</td>', 'Wow that is a lot of negative space!  I like it..simple, elegant, and good lighting....8', '2007-07-26 14:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939822, 560420, 68256, '<td valign="top">Classic still life so you start out on a better scale than other photos....plus your lighting is terrific (well except for those "catchlights" i the wide bottle which are just a little distracting to me).  The grapes falling off doesn''t really work for me as they seem to be floating...also the wide bottle looks like it isn''t straight up and down (I admit that could be my eyes!)....So overall unity, composition, lighting...very well done.  8</td>', 'Classic still life so you start out on a better scale than other photos....plus your lighting is terrific (well except for those "catchlights" i the wide bottle which are just a little distracting to me).  The grapes falling off doesn''t really work for me as they seem to be floating...also the wide bottle looks like it isn''t straight up and down (I admit that could be my eyes!)....So overall unity, composition, lighting...very well done.  8', '2007-07-26 14:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939828, 557483, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very simple and beautiful composition.  I love the lighting but I think perhaps a little more key light would have created some soft interesting shadows (a little darker than they are now) which would have added interest for me.  Great shot nonetheless...8</td>', 'Very simple and beautiful composition.  I love the lighting but I think perhaps a little more key light would have created some soft interesting shadows (a little darker than they are now) which would have added interest for me.  Great shot nonetheless...8', '2007-07-26 14:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939829, 560408, 81082, '<td valign="top">Humorous, nice arrangement.</td>', 'Humorous, nice arrangement.', '2007-07-26 14:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939832, 560267, 81082, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Perfect background color. Very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Lovely. Perfect background color. Very pleasing to the eye.', '2007-07-26 14:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3939839, 560318, 81082, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shade of red, and nice work on using an extreme close-up to convey so much.</td>', 'Beautiful shade of red, and nice work on using an extreme close-up to convey so much.', '2007-07-26 14:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
