(3941931, 558912, 44825, '<td valign="top">This shot appears to be a little too closely cropped. Apart from the watch and rounds everything else is leaving shot and is not complete. It may have improved the shot to have a complete glass for instance.<br/> <br/>Focus and lighting in good but the composition of some of the objects lets the shot down.</td>', 'This shot appears to be a little too closely cropped. Apart from the watch and rounds everything else is leaving shot and is not complete. It may have improved the shot to have a complete glass for instance. Focus and lighting in good but the composition of some of the objects lets the shot down.', '2007-07-27 04:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
