(3941959, 560569, 44825, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. the subject is well composed. one small criticism it may have been a little too tightly cropped. I think that it might have been better to have a little more background in the top of the shot so that the tomato and onion(?)created a more interesting ''skyline''. Focus is spot on and the lighting is also quite subtle. Well done.</td>', 'I like this shot. the subject is well composed. one small criticism it may have been a little too tightly cropped. I think that it might have been better to have a little more background in the top of the shot so that the tomato and onion(?)created a more interesting ''skyline''. Focus is spot on and the lighting is also quite subtle. Well done.', '2007-07-27 04:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941962, 559989, 44825, '<td valign="top">This shot might have been better without the glass - it does not help the composition and distracts the eye away from the fruit because of the highlight. The background is good and enhances the greens in the grapes.</td>', 'This shot might have been better without the glass - it does not help the composition and distracts the eye away from the fruit because of the highlight. The background is good and enhances the greens in the grapes.', '2007-07-27 04:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
