(3943674, 560093, 66952, '<td valign="top">A great idea, kinda surreal. The B&amp;W conversion is well done. I think I would have cropped a little tighter. The birdcage and the window are the real focus of the image, and the rest of the left and the bottom don''t really add anything. 6</td>', 'A great idea, kinda surreal. The B&W conversion is well done. I think I would have cropped a little tighter. The birdcage and the window are the real focus of the image, and the rest of the left and the bottom don''t really add anything. 6', '2007-07-27 20:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
