(3944080, 559543, 77196, '<td valign="top">The white gap on the left side is a major distraction from this otherwise great idea. Love the colors. Games are slightly OOF - picture seems a bit grainy.</td>', 'The white gap on the left side is a major distraction from this otherwise great idea. Love the colors. Games are slightly OOF - picture seems a bit grainy.', '2007-07-28 00:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
