(3944085, 560509, 77196, '<td valign="top">DOF problems - only 1 nut is in focus - not sure why the one is so far away from the others.</td>', 'DOF problems - only 1 nut is in focus - not sure why the one is so far away from the others.', '2007-07-28 00:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
