(3946211, 560288, 81177, '<td valign="top">I think this is brilliant. Having tried something similar I know how hard it is to get right. Stunning</td>', 'I think this is brilliant. Having tried something similar I know how hard it is to get right. Stunning', '2007-07-29 05:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3946269, 558640, 44825, '<td valign="top">I like the classic still life shot. The subject matter, lighting and focus are all good. The composition is OK everything is well placed except the glass. It may have been better IMO to have place the glass behind the apples and next to the strawberries - effectively where it is but further back. I think that the eye is distracted by the glass and by placing further into the shot the strawberries would stand out more and the eye would be looking at a pyramid of subject matter.</td>', 'I like the classic still life shot. The subject matter, lighting and focus are all good. The composition is OK everything is well placed except the glass. It may have been better IMO to have place the glass behind the apples and next to the strawberries - effectively where it is but further back. I think that the eye is distracted by the glass and by placing further into the shot the strawberries would stand out more and the eye would be looking at a pyramid of subject matter.', '2007-07-29 08:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3946270, 559893, 44825, '<td valign="top">NOT a still life - this is a landscape.</td>', 'NOT a still life - this is a landscape.', '2007-07-29 08:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
