(3954943, 558821, 81433, '<td valign="top">This picture looks to be slanted to the right.  I like the idea but I think you can put a little more light on the fruit being careful not to bleach it out.  Other than that, I think it is a nice picture.  I like that grape over there by itself.  You might want to think about dropping one or more onto the cloth on the table also??  Just an idea.</td>', 'This picture looks to be slanted to the right.  I like the idea but I think you can put a little more light on the fruit being careful not to bleach it out.  Other than that, I think it is a nice picture.  I like that grape over there by itself.  You might want to think about dropping one or more onto the cloth on the table also??  Just an idea.', '2007-08-01 00:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3954948, 560490, 81433, '<td valign="top">Nice colors here.  I think maybe the orange one needs some help?  Maybe a little darker or more saturation.  I like it, not for my living room, but for a day care center or nursery that needs some happy colors.  Thank you for sharing.</td>', 'Nice colors here.  I think maybe the orange one needs some help?  Maybe a little darker or more saturation.  I like it, not for my living room, but for a day care center or nursery that needs some happy colors.  Thank you for sharing.', '2007-08-01 00:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
