(3954954, 559989, 81433, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  I especially like the background idea.  Looks like fiberglass.  The greens in the grapes and pear seem to be a bit too bright.  Maybe tone those down a little.  I think the eye might like that better.  The picture is clear and sharp.  I like that.  Thank you.</td>', 'I like this picture.  I especially like the background idea.  Looks like fiberglass.  The greens in the grapes and pear seem to be a bit too bright.  Maybe tone those down a little.  I think the eye might like that better.  The picture is clear and sharp.  I like that.  Thank you.', '2007-08-01 00:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3954972, 558640, 81433, '<td valign="top">This is nicely composed. Because it is healthy, the background needs to be lighter - not so dark.  The fruit could be lightened and sharpened a little.  I do like the frost on the cool glass of water.  That looks very inviting.  I do like how you have the strawberries as tall as the glass and the other things shorter.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is nicely composed. Because it is healthy, the background needs to be lighter - not so dark.  The fruit could be lightened and sharpened a little.  I do like the frost on the cool glass of water.  That looks very inviting.  I do like how you have the strawberries as tall as the glass and the other things shorter.  Nice job.', '2007-08-01 00:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3954983, 559976, 81433, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  The lighting is good, the crispness and clarity is well done.  This would look nice framed and hung in a kitchen.  Good job.</td>', 'This is very nice.  The lighting is good, the crispness and clarity is well done.  This would look nice framed and hung in a kitchen.  Good job.', '2007-08-01 00:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3954996, 557809, 81433, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject but the red building in the background distracts from it.  The tree growing out the top of the tombstone doesn''t do too much for it either.  The words on the stone are clear and easily read.  Good focus.  If you could blur the background that might help the overall picture.</td>', 'This is a good subject but the red building in the background distracts from it.  The tree growing out the top of the tombstone doesn''t do too much for it either.  The words on the stone are clear and easily read.  Good focus.  If you could blur the background that might help the overall picture.', '2007-08-01 00:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
