(3958336, 560530, 71931, '<td valign="top">That comment about lighting is quite apt.  I noted that, while I was rating other photos, I was noting lighting (good or bad) quite a bit, and came to realize that that was something which I had not taken enough note of in my own shot.  I also had too many objects in it.  Well, what this place is all about, eh?  Shoot and learn ;-)  Over all, I''m pleased with the rating this shot got.</td>', 'That comment about lighting is quite apt.  I noted that, while I was rating other photos, I was noting lighting (good or bad) quite a bit, and came to realize that that was something which I had not taken enough note of in my own shot.  I also had too many objects in it.  Well, what this place is all about, eh?  Shoot and learn ;-)  Over all, I''m pleased with the rating this shot got.', '2007-08-01 17:10:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3958337, 558840, 76567, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing, a well deserved win.</td>', 'Absolutely amazing, a well deserved win.', '2007-08-01 17:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
