(3958545, 560458, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail and lighting. Maybe a bit more of the jar, but then it might throw the composition out of wack. I''m actually quite jealous, this is a splendid photo!</td>', 'Very nice detail and lighting. Maybe a bit more of the jar, but then it might throw the composition out of wack. I''m actually quite jealous, this is a splendid photo!', '2007-08-01 18:16:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3958548, 559453, 62318, '<td valign="top">Cool Still-Life. I like this, outside of the norm but still fitting the challenge very nicely. Feels like I am looking up just a bit, but nothing that takes away from the composition as a whole. Superb shot (mid-6 material in my book).</td>', 'Cool Still-Life. I like this, outside of the norm but still fitting the challenge very nicely. Feels like I am looking up just a bit, but nothing that takes away from the composition as a whole. Superb shot (mid-6 material in my book).', '2007-08-01 18:17:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3958556, 560494, 62318, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I think this was underscored. The textured wall really gives a sense of place along with the nice pink contrast. Love the lighting on the wall. At first I thought the shot might have been too compressed in the frame, but really it does have good movement. A very nice shot.</td>', 'Hmmm, I think this was underscored. The textured wall really gives a sense of place along with the nice pink contrast. Love the lighting on the wall. At first I thought the shot might have been too compressed in the frame, but really it does have good movement. A very nice shot.', '2007-08-01 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3958561, 560343, 22301, '<td valign="top">very cool DoF IMO. it really works well.</td>', 'very cool DoF IMO. it really works well.', '2007-08-01 18:20:47.000000', NULL, 0),
