(3963596, 558840, 4416, '<td valign="top">That was me on PhotoSig, five years ago :) Jeff is right, it was not my original idea either.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Spizzer:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by slickchik:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by temmermb:</b></div><hr/><i> I was sure I already saw <a href="//www.photosig.com/go/photos/view?id=276308&amp;forward=" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this picture</a> - is this from the same person? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am curious about this... any ideas or thoughts?<br/> <br/>I don''t know what to make of it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That was not me.  I did shamelessly use it as something to shoot for, though.  He said it is not his original, either.   It is not me, if that is what you are thinking.<br/> <br/>jeff </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-02 23:30:56.</i></td>', 'That was me on PhotoSig, five years ago :) Jeff is right, it was not my original idea either. Originally posted by Spizzer: Originally posted by slickchik: Originally posted by temmermb: I was sure I already saw this picture - is this from the same person?   I am curious about this... any ideas or thoughts? I don''t know what to make of it.   That was not me.  I did shamelessly use it as something to shoot for, though.  He said it is not his original, either.   It is not me, if that is what you are thinking. jeff ', '2007-08-02 23:31:11.000000', '2007-08-03 00:30:56.000000', 0),
