(3967398, 560169, 74979, '<td valign="top">i thought this was a great imnage during the challenge, and sorry it didn''t fit the bill for many "purists" in the DPC crowd..<br/> <br/>that pup is just waiting for that tennis ball to say or do something!!<br/>Love it!<br/> <br/>btw, try a tighter crop from the top- bring it down to just below the pup''s left ear, across the top of his head (it''s 2 downward rolls on my mouse)...I think it gives his stare more impact<br/> <br/></td>', 'i thought this was a great imnage during the challenge, and sorry it didn''t fit the bill for many "purists" in the DPC crowd.. that pup is just waiting for that tennis ball to say or do something!!Love it! btw, try a tighter crop from the top- bring it down to just below the pup''s left ear, across the top of his head (it''s 2 downward rolls on my mouse)...I think it gives his stare more impact ', '2007-08-04 00:19:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3967424, 559548, 37930, '<td valign="top">This was my personal pick for blue ribbon. Very nice indeed. So simple to make and print something like that in photoshop yet I''ve never seen anyone do that before. It''s these kinds of things that make excellent photos--simple, original ideas. Your set-up, lighting, focus, exposure, all that stuff is all nice, but the idea itself is what won. I love this stuff and I love seeing images like this win. Congrats =] (Nice message, too. Honour killings should be condemned by all levels of government in those nations, not just discouraged.)</td>', 'This was my personal pick for blue ribbon. Very nice indeed. So simple to make and print something like that in photoshop yet I''ve never seen anyone do that before. It''s these kinds of things that make excellent photos--simple, original ideas. Your set-up, lighting, focus, exposure, all that stuff is all nice, but the idea itself is what won. I love this stuff and I love seeing images like this win. Congrats =] (Nice message, too. Honour killings should be condemned by all levels of government in those nations, not just discouraged.)', '2007-08-04 00:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3967609, 557355, 37930, '<td valign="top">I think this was deserving of a way higher score, flower shot or not. The challenge rules didn''t really describe what kind of still life, which I thought left it open to things like this. Cool looking plant, nice bokeh, and pin sharp focus.</td>', 'I think this was deserving of a way higher score, flower shot or not. The challenge rules didn''t really describe what kind of still life, which I thought left it open to things like this. Cool looking plant, nice bokeh, and pin sharp focus.', '2007-08-04 01:44:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3967712, 558970, 57229, '<td valign="top">Så lite oppmuntrende vi er her da.<br/> <br/>Synd, når dette er et ganske godt bilde. Skarphet, komponering, lys- og fargebalanse osv er helt ok.<br/> <br/>Problemet (i forhold til evaluering her) oppstår sannsynligvis rundt det uttrykket ''still life'', som <u>ikke</u> vil si ''stillestående liv''. På norsk heter det ''stillben'', og er oftest et bilde of ubesjelet (?) ting ordnet for komposisjonens skyld - gjerne frukt og blomst i klassiske malerkunst, men her kan det òg bare være ting som er stilt opp av kunstnerens hånd for å lage bilde.<br/> <br/>Skytt au. Folk leter kanskje etter svake grunn til å domme ned. Prøv neste challenge.</td>', 'Så lite oppmuntrende vi er her da. Synd, når dette er et ganske godt bilde. Skarphet, komponering, lys- og fargebalanse osv er helt ok. Problemet (i forhold til evaluering her) oppstår sannsynligvis rundt det uttrykket ''still life'', som ikke vil si ''stillestående liv''. På norsk heter det ''stillben'', og er oftest et bilde of ubesjelet (?) ting ordnet for komposisjonens skyld - gjerne frukt og blomst i klassiske malerkunst, men her kan det òg bare være ting som er stilt opp av kunstnerens hånd for å lage bilde. Skytt au. Folk leter kanskje etter svake grunn til å domme ned. Prøv neste challenge.', '2007-08-04 03:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
